                                      "text": [
                                        "Not Waste",
                                        "A shelf holds\nparts too worn for\npressure work but\nstill useful for",
                                        "training. Each\nbears a clear red\ncross and a\nwritten TRAINING\nlabel.",
                                        "Rivet would rather\nteach with a real\nfailed part than\nlet a new",
                                        "worker learn\nfailure on a live\npipe."
