                                  {
                                    "id": "8de73c33-9d0a-4f19-afc3-0bf75e5f5057",
                                    "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                                    "args": {
                                      "text": [
                                        "Process cards: FIT\nspring before\nenergizing. SET\nlimit after\nfitting. TEST with",
                                        "power last. Card\norder is not a\nsuggestion. The\ninspector asks if\nthe wooden spoon",
                                        "is approved\nequipment. Rivet\nsays it is\napproved for\nmoving his ruler."
