                                          "args": {
                                            "text": [
                                              "Rivet checks a\npractice packet\nwith four branch\nnames and only\nthree received",
                                              "marks. Frostwick,\nCandy, and\nBrassworks have\nsigned. Velvet has\na sent entry but",
                                              "no received mark.\nMoxie is free to\ncarry a copy; the\nlamp card cannot\nconfirm it. Pip",
                                              "starts to count\nthe sent entry as\nclose enough,\ncatches himself,\nand leaves the",
                                              "empty box visible.\nNib would rather\nanswer a real",
                                              "check than be\ncongratulated by\nassumption."
